 <h3><u>Aye baba husaina</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>(Shaam e ghariba'n) ..(2)</p> 
  <p>Aye Shaam e ghariba'n</p> 
  <p>Jab Shaam e ghariba'n me yaad e padar aayi<br> Aur ghabrake SAKINA sare maqtal chali aayi<br> Daaman tha jala aur labo'n par tha yeh nauha</p> 
  <p>(Aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)<br> (Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)</p> 
  <p>Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA</p> 
  <p>(1) Hain aap jaha baba, mujhko bula lijiye<br> Ek baar mujhe, apne seene pe sula lijiye<br> Bin aap ke duniya me bekaar hai yeh jeena</p> 
  <p>(Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)<br> Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA</p> 
  <p>(2) Hain kaan mere zakhmi, aur khoon bhi hain jaari<br> Khaymo'n ki, ridaaon ki, karti hu Azadari<br> Kuch der sukoon pau, mil jao agar Baba</p> 
  <p>(Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)<br> Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA</p> 
  <p>(3) Kis samt tumhe dhundhu, maqtal me bhatakti hu<br> Baba ki samajhkar mai, har laash pe girti hu<br> Imdaad karo meri, batlao mujhe rasta</p> 
  <p>(Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) .. (2)<br> Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA</p> 
  <p>(4) Kuch der lipatkar main, bas aapke laashe se<br> Woh dard sunaugi, baad aapke jo paye<br> Har baat batau main, mil jaye agar lasha</p> 
  <p>(Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)<br> Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA</p> 
  <p>(5) Is dasht me roti hu, sab chahne walo'n ko<br> Har samt andhera hai, tarsi hu ujalo'n ko<br> Baad apke aye Baba, taareek hai yeh duniya</p> 
  <p>(Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)<br> Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA (S.A)<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA</p> 
  <p>(6) SHABBIR&nbsp; ke nauhe se, phir gunj utha sehra<br> Ho tere masaeb par, qurban tera Baba<br> Ek teer laga dil par, sunkar yeh tera girya</p> 
  <p>(Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)<br> Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA</p> 
  <p>(7) Irfan bhi rota hain, is baat pe Mazhar bhi<br> Roti thi SAKINA bhi, aur lashaye sarwar bhi<br> Awaaz e padar sunkar, us samt chali dukhiya</p> 
  <p>(Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA) ..(2)<br> Roti hain SAKINA, pyaasi hain SAKINA<br> Ayna ayna aye Baba HUSSAINA<br> aye Baba HUSSAINA..(2)</p> 
